  {
   "id": "tirisfal-1-12:096",
   "tags": {},
   "text": [
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Agamand Mills (west of the gnolls, 42-51, 28-44):"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Gregor Agamand (45.8, 29.4), Thurman Agamand (42.8, 32.5) and Nissa Agamand (49.7, 36.3): kill each for their remains. They are level 10, pull them alone."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Thurman also drops A Letter to Yvette: accept A Letter Undelivered."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Cracked Skull Soldiers (north) and Rattlecage Soldiers (south) drop 5 Notched Ribs; Darkeye Bonecasters (everywhere) drop 3 Blackened Skulls."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Devlin Agamand (in the south mill, 47.2, 40.0): kill him for Devlin's Remains."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Then head north-east to Garren's Haunt (next step) and come home along the coast road."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
