      {
       "t": "On the way back east: Maggot Eye (level 11, in the house at Garren's Haunt, 58.7, 30.8): kill him for Maggot Eye's Paw. Clear the gnolls around the house first and pull him alone."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "North coast just past him (58-65, 26-31): kill Vile Fin Puddlejumpers and Minor Oracles for 5 Vile Fin Scales. The Minor Oracles also drop the 3 Vile Fin Murloc Skins for Shelene."
      }
     ]
    }
